    {
      "id": "u_4e51fcb832133bbb73e6ccb8_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "So now the \"Bash\" subtree appears on multiple locations in the hierarchy. Both the Bash subtrees are the same and contain the same sub-categories and notes.",
