    {
      "id": "u_0d452171509a6ee79b99a95a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In the demo, you can see how a clone can be created using the context menu. It's possible to do this also using the Add Link dialog or with __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__C__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and __TRILIUM_PH_4__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_5__+__TRILIUM_PH_6__V__TRILIUM_PH_7__ __TRILIUM_PH_8__keyboard shortcuts__TRILIUM_PH_9__.",
      "sourceHash": "0d452171509a6ee79b99a95a8f6e0d017809e4580c6c3f985da4791363f886e8",
      "context": "Cloning Notes > Solution > Demo",
      "contextHash": "cfe382790fbe04a5e4adc84e2195c84faeec8571ad71d9dd50433f148957bac0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4c7d93f39145faa456d25420_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "You can view the list of all available clones:",
      "sourceHash": "4c7d93f39145faa456d25420a49e25aa66d3ba0fb4ab30b1b98a824082602c05",
      "context": "Cloning Notes > Solution > Demo",
      "contextHash": "cfe382790fbe04a5e4adc84e2195c84faeec8571ad71d9dd50433f148957bac0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d0a3fbdafd608113a41435d6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Status bar__TRILIUM_PH_1__, by looking for the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ icon.",
      "sourceHash": "d0a3fbdafd608113a41435d6fc2f601511b8992d8d56a488c22497e90ecbb5f2",
      "context": "Cloning Notes > Solution > Demo",
      "contextHash": "cfe382790fbe04a5e4adc84e2195c84faeec8571ad71d9dd50433f148957bac0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0a6ed9c2386b5c12de97acd6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Connections tab__TRILIUM_PH_1__ of the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Right Sidebar__TRILIUM_PH_3__, by looking at the __TRILIUM_PH_4__Note paths__TRILIUM_PH_5__ section.",
      "sourceHash": "0a6ed9c2386b5c12de97acd6c1ff2dc834e87680ac5d8ad3419cb8cdbfbd2938",
      "context": "Cloning Notes > Solution > Demo",
      "contextHash": "cfe382790fbe04a5e4adc84e2195c84faeec8571ad71d9dd50433f148957bac0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_eba4ca0d0030129f467ad1e6_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__, on desktop and on mobile, the title of a cloned note is followed by a __TRILIUM_PH_2__ icon, to easily see that the note is also placed into some other location. A shared note is followed by a __TRILIUM_PH_3__ icon in the same way.",
      "sourceHash": "eba4ca0d0030129f467ad1e6b38e7fa66a3c19155075fb42bcc541ad74206f23",
      "context": "Cloning Notes > Solution > Demo",
      "contextHash": "cfe382790fbe04a5e4adc84e2195c84faeec8571ad71d9dd50433f148957bac0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_28ab8dc08f58c9be29344616_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Deleting notes/clones__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
